      "message": "This line is almost certainly the root cause of the change in behaviour I see when syncing.\n\nWhen I add `target_os \u003d [ \"android\" ] to .gclient, without this CL, it downloads the \"clank\" repo. With this CL, it does not.\n\nI\u0027d suggest instead inheriting from SCMWrapper, and instead create a decorator `@maybe_git_wrapper` that decides whether to `super()` call or not.\n\nThat way, git wrapper is opt-out rather than opt-in, so we can\u0027t miss anything.",
